{"synopsis":"Dari peri peri slime bendabenda hadiah iblis dan banyak lagi tak terhitung berapa banyak reinkarnasi yang telah terjadi untuk mendapatkan kehidupan yang baru Aku Lee Seo Jun telah terlahir kembali sebagai anak manusia\nDi perpustakaan kehidupanku di mana kenangan kehidupan sebelumnya tetap seperti dongeng Aku kebetulan melihat kehidupan masa lalu dengan kehidupan impian yang sangat kuinginkan Selain itu aku diberi kemampuan yang menarik perhatian orang\nDengan wajah tampanku yang melakukan semua kerja keras Kemampuan aktingku yang luar biasa Kali ini akhirnya aku akan meraih mimpiku dan menjadi seorang superstar\nAyow swemangwat Aksen bayi","alternative_title":"0살부터 슈퍼스타","author":"Buggeugom","artist":"Jyanna","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"edceeffd-0ee7-4a2a-ac2e-9ea0e93191aa","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"05b2871f-ef7f-4cb1-9c02-5b339011c9fb","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"d303f843-aaac-419d-96b5-3d52b1e8facd","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"b760e7f5-8752-4f01-881a-9b46d06adf38","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"7311bb75-3966-40b7-939f-6e05d793b7d1","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"e26114f2-dba3-4df7-ba38-fdff3c699f07","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"","date":"2026-04-12","released":"2026-04-12"},{"chapter_id":"d5539b38-cde6-414a-9775-3f67547a8f52","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2026-03-29","released":"2026-03-29"},{"chapter_id":"9fa2c001-f76f-4214-b2bf-c7f5ff6285c9","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"","date":"2026-03-23","released":"2026-03-23"},{"chapter_id":"7f17540c-9f79-4b7d-b95d-1e46a7ff06c1","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"","date":"2026-03-15","released":"2026-03-15"},{"chapter_id"